    "question": "Let f and g be functions defined as f(x)=x+1, g(x)=2x. Find (f \u2218 g)(x) and (g \u2218 f)(x).",
    "marks": 5,
    "section": "B",
    "sources": [
      "MQP"
    ],
    "topic": "Function Composition",
    "unit": "Unit 1",
    "priorityScore": 85,
